001400 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001500 PROGRAM-ID.    USB200.
001600 AUTHOR.        YAMADA.
001700 DATE-WRITTEN.  1996-01-22.
001800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001900 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002000 SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
002100 OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
002200 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002300 FILE-CONTROL.
002400     SELECT TKFL    ASSIGN TO TOKUI
002500                    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
002600     SELECT URFL    ASSIGN TO URIAGE
002700                    ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
002800     SELECT SKFL    ASSIGN TO SEIKYU
002900                    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
003000 DATA DIVISION.
003100 FILE SECTION.
003200 FD  TKFL.
003300     COPY TOKUREC.
003400 FD  URFL.
003500     COPY URIREC.
003600 FD  SKFL.
003700     COPY SEIKREC.
003800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003900 01  SP-AREA.
004000     03  SP-SIME                 PIC 9(02).
004100     03  SP-YM                   PIC 9(06).
004200     03  SP-FROM                 PIC 9(08).
004300     03  SP-TO                   PIC 9(08).
004400     03  SP-TO-R REDEFINES SP-TO.
004500         05  SP-TO-YM            PIC 9(06).
004600         05  SP-TO-DD            PIC 9(02).
004700     03  SP-RC                   PIC 9(02).
004800 01  W-PARM.
004900     03  W-GYOMU             PIC 9(08).
005000     03  W-GYOMU-R REDEFINES W-GYOMU.
005100         05  W-GYOMU-YM      PIC 9(06).
005200         05  W-GYOMU-DD      PIC 9(02).
005300     03  W-FROM-YM           PIC 9(06).
005400 01  W-TKEY                  PIC X(06).
005500 01  W-UKEY                  PIC X(06).
005600 01  W-TO-YM                 PIC 9(06).
005700 01  W-YM                    PIC 9(06).
005800 01  W-YM-R REDEFINES W-YM.
005900     03  W-YY                PIC 9(04).
006000     03  W-MM                PIC 9(02).
006100 01  W-SKSU                  PIC 9(07)  VALUE ZERO.
006200 01  W-URSU                  PIC 9(07)  VALUE ZERO.
006300 01  W-TAISYO                PIC 9(07)  VALUE ZERO.
006400 01  W-TOBASI                PIC 9(07)  VALUE ZERO.
006500 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
006600 A000.
006700     ACCEPT W-PARM FROM SYSIN.
006800     MOVE W-GYOMU-YM TO W-TO-YM.
006900     DISPLAY 'USB200 SIME ' W-FROM-YM ' - ' W-TO-YM.
007000     OPEN INPUT  TKFL URFL
007100          OUTPUT SKFL.
007200     PERFORM R100 THRU R100-EXIT.
007300     PERFORM R200 THRU R200-EXIT.
007400*
007500 A100.
007600     IF W-TKEY = HIGH-VALUE
007700        GO TO A900.
007800 A110.
007900     IF W-UKEY < W-TKEY
008000        ADD 1 TO W-TOBASI
008100        PERFORM R200 THRU R200-EXIT
008200        GO TO A110.
008300     MOVE W-FROM-YM TO W-YM.
008400 A200.
008500     IF W-YM > W-TO-YM
008600        GO TO A300.
008700     MOVE TK-SIME TO SP-SIME.
008800     MOVE W-YM    TO SP-YM.
008900     CALL 'USB210' USING SP-AREA.
009000     IF SP-RC NOT = ZERO
009100        DISPLAY 'USB200 SIME ERROR ' TK-CD ' ' SP-SIME
009200        GO TO A250.
009300     INITIALIZE SK-REC.
009400     MOVE W-YM     TO SK-NO (1:6).
009500     MOVE TK-CD    TO SK-NO (7:6).
009600     MOVE TK-CD    TO SK-TK-CD.
009700     MOVE W-YM     TO SK-YM.
009800     MOVE SP-FROM  TO SK-FROM.
009900     MOVE SP-TO    TO SK-TO.
010000     MOVE '0'      TO SK-KESI.
010100 A210.
010200     IF W-UKEY NOT = W-TKEY
010300        GO TO A240.
010400     IF UR-DATE < SP-FROM
010500        ADD 1 TO W-TOBASI
010600        PERFORM R200 THRU R200-EXIT
010700        GO TO A210.
010800     IF UR-DATE > SP-TO
010900        GO TO A240.
011000     PERFORM K100 THRU K100-EXIT.
011100     PERFORM R200 THRU R200-EXIT.
011200     GO TO A210.
011300 A240.
011400     IF SK-KENSU > ZERO
011500        WRITE SK-REC
011600        ADD 1 TO W-SKSU.
011700 A250.
011800     ADD 1 TO W-MM.
011900     IF W-MM > 12
012000        MOVE 1 TO W-MM
012100        ADD 1 TO W-YY.
012200     GO TO A200.
012300*
012400 A300.
012500     IF W-UKEY = W-TKEY
012600        PERFORM R200 THRU R200-EXIT
012700        GO TO A300.
012800     PERFORM R100 THRU R100-EXIT.
012900     GO TO A100.
013000*
013100 A900.
013200     CLOSE TKFL URFL SKFL.
013300     DISPLAY 'USB200 URIAGE=' W-URSU ' TAISYO=' W-TAISYO
013400             ' SEIKYU=' W-SKSU ' TOBASI=' W-TOBASI.
013500     STOP RUN.
013600*
013700*    請求集計
013800 K100.
013900     ADD 1          TO W-TAISYO.
014000     ADD 1          TO SK-KENSU.
014100     ADD URIAGE-KIN TO SK-URIAGE.
014200     ADD UR-ZEI-KIN TO SK-ZEI.
014300     COMPUTE SK-SEIKYU = SK-URIAGE + SK-ZEI.
014400* 2019.08 改修 佐藤
014500     IF ZEI-KBN = '2'
014600        ADD URIAGE-KIN TO SK-Z8K-TAISYO
014700        ADD UR-ZEI-KIN TO SK-Z8K
014800        GO TO K100-EXIT.
014900     IF UR-ZEI-RITU = 10
015000        ADD URIAGE-KIN TO SK-Z10-TAISYO
015100        ADD UR-ZEI-KIN TO SK-Z10
015200        GO TO K100-EXIT.
015300     ADD URIAGE-KIN TO SK-SONOTA-TAISYO.
015400     ADD UR-ZEI-KIN TO SK-SONOTA.
015500 K100-EXIT.
015600     EXIT.
015700*
015800 R100.
015900     READ TKFL
016000         AT END MOVE HIGH-VALUE TO W-TKEY
016100                GO TO R100-EXIT.
016200     MOVE TK-CD TO W-TKEY.
016300 R100-EXIT.
016400     EXIT.
016500*
016600 R200.
016700     READ URFL
016800         AT END MOVE HIGH-VALUE TO W-UKEY
016900                GO TO R200-EXIT.
017000     ADD 1 TO W-URSU.
017100     MOVE UR-TK-CD TO W-UKEY.
017200 R200-EXIT.
017300     EXIT.
